      "@id": "kt:autogen",
      "@type": "kto:Tool",
      "skos:prefLabel": "AutoGen: Enabling Next-Gen LLM Applications via Multi-Agent Conversation",
      "skos:definition": "An open-source Python framework and 2023 paper from Microsoft Research and academic collaborators in which LLM applications are built as conversations among customisable \"conversable agents\" (backed by LLMs, humans, tools or code execution) that reply to each other automatically; redesigned as an event-driven v0.4 in 2025 and later archived in favour of Microsoft Agent Framework.",
