      "skos:prefLabel": "Tool use",
      "skos:definition": "The capability of a language model to call external functions, APIs and programs: the model emits a structured request (a tool name plus arguments matching a declared schema), the application or provider executes it, and the result is fed back into the context so the model can continue or answer.",
