      "skos:definition": "British-Canadian cognitive psychologist and computer scientist (born 1947) whose work on backpropagation, Boltzmann machines, dropout and deep convolutional networks helped found modern deep learning; co-recipient of the 2018 ACM Turing Award and the 2024 Nobel Prize in Physics.",
