      "@id": "kt:eu-ai-act",
      "@type": "kto:Policy",
      "skos:prefLabel": "EU AI Act",
      "skos:definition": "Regulation (EU) 2024/1689, the European Union's horizontal law on artificial intelligence, which sorts AI systems into risk tiers (prohibited, high-risk, transparency, minimal), sets separate duties for providers of general-purpose AI models, and is enforced by national authorities and the Commission's AI Office.",
