      "@id": "kt:speculative-decoding",
      "@type": "kto:Technique",
      "skos:prefLabel": "Speculative decoding",
      "skos:definition": "An inference technique that speeds up autoregressive generation by letting a cheap draft mechanism propose several tokens that the large target model then verifies in a single parallel forward pass, using a rejection-sampling rule that leaves the target model's output distribution unchanged.",
