      "skos:prefLabel": "Hidden Markov model",
      "skos:definition": "A generative probabilistic model of sequences in which an unobserved Markov chain of discrete states emits the observed symbols or feature vectors; its likelihood, most probable state path and parameters are computed with the forward, Viterbi and Baum-Welch (forward-backward) algorithms.",
