      "skos:definition": "A NeurIPS 2023 paper by Madaan et al. introducing Self-Refine, an inference-time method in which one language model drafts an output, critiques it in natural language, and rewrites it using that critique, repeating the loop without any extra training, supervised data or reinforcement learning.",
