      "@id": "kt:test-time-compute",
      "@type": "kto:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "Test-time compute",
      "skos:definition": "The computation a trained model spends at inference on a given input, and the practice of deliberately increasing it (longer reasoning chains, many samples, search against a verifier) to improve answer quality instead of, or in addition to, training a larger model.",
