      "@id": "kt:glove",
      "@type": "kto:Algorithm",
      "skos:prefLabel": "GloVe",
      "skos:definition": "A static word-embedding method from Pennington, Socher and Manning at Stanford (EMNLP 2014) that fits word and context vectors by weighted least squares so that their dot product approximates the log of how often two words co-occur across a whole corpus, uniting count-based matrix factorisation with prediction-style embeddings.",
