      "@id": "kt:semantic-search",
      "@type": "kto:Technique",
      "skos:prefLabel": "Semantic search",
      "skos:definition": "An information retrieval approach that ranks documents by how closely their meaning matches a query's, rather than by exact keyword overlap, typically by mapping queries and documents into a shared vector space and returning the nearest items.",
