      "@id": "kt:constitutional-ai",
      "@type": "kto:Technique",
      "skos:prefLabel": "Constitutional AI",
      "skos:definition": "An alignment training method, introduced by Anthropic in 2022, in which a short written list of natural-language principles (a \"constitution\") replaces human harmlessness labels: the model critiques and revises its own outputs against those principles, then is refined with reinforcement learning from AI-generated preference labels.",
