      "@id": "kt:instruction-tuning",
      "@type": "kto:Technique",
      "skos:prefLabel": "Instruction tuning",
      "skos:definition": "A fine-tuning technique that trains a pretrained language model on many tasks phrased as natural-language instructions paired with target responses, so that it follows instructions and generalizes zero-shot to tasks it was never trained on.",
