      "@id": "kt:rlhf",
      "@type": "kto:Technique",
      "skos:prefLabel": "Reinforcement learning from human feedback",
      "skos:definition": "A training technique in which humans compare model outputs, a reward model is fitted to those preferences, and the model (policy) is then optimized with reinforcement learning to maximize the learned reward, usually under a penalty that keeps it close to its starting point.",
